OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn former nightclub
OL,4,Ainto college
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn a former city centre
OL,7,Ftheatre and nightclub into a new
OL,8,Fcollege have been submitted.
OL,10,FUK Management College Ltd, which
OL,11,Falready has a campus in Derby's
OL,12,FCornmarket, want to turn the former
OL,13,FDerby Grand Theatre building, on
OL,14,FBabington Lane, into a site with 10
OL,15,Fclassrooms, an IT lab, board meeting
OL,16,Froom, learning hub, cafe and lounge.
OL,18,FThe site, which was once home to
OL,19,FMcClusky's nightclub and most recently
OL,20,FHouse of Holes indoor crazy golf, could
OL,21,Fhold a capacity of 250 people,
OL,22,Fdocuments said.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
